"args":["雒城外  劉備军主营"]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["鳳雛殞落"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["本關是「落鳳坡之戰」，\n我們將以劉備軍的視角遊玩。\n如果達成特定條件，可以獲得鳳凰羽衣。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[90,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&庞统\n主公，咱們终于要攻陷雒城了。\n&刘备\n是嗎？依我看來雒城易守難攻，\n這應該是一場硬仗啊。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&庞统\n主公哪兒的話！\n我可是人稱鳳雛的智者欸，\n難道還會誤算嗎？\n&庞统\n不管是什麼樣的敵人，都不會是我的對手！\n哈哈哈哈哈哈！\n&刘备\n士元，你可千萬不能大意呀……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[90,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[46,5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关平\n(是我的错觉吗？虽然副军师与诸葛\n军师齐名，但是他俩的表现怎麽差这\n麽多呢？)"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[46,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,1,0,0,0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":2,"offset":1311,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":1313,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":1334,"body_end":1431,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":7,"name":"test_pending","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n出发。"]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":1431,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":1456,"body_end":1843,"conditi