统\n主公请放心，我可是人称凤雏的智者，\n他们根本不可能料到我的妙计。\n&刘备\n…………"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[90,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":2146,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2171,"body_end":2372,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[37]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏延\n主公请放心，我会陪伴副军师奇袭。\n就算真有伏兵，依然万无一失。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[90,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&庞统\n喂喂喂，都跟你们说了敌人不可能\n那么聪明，怎么就是不信呢。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏延\n…………"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[90,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":2372,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2397,"body_end":2459,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[36]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&黄忠\n咱们最好多买些补给品，\n以备不时之需。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":2459,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2484,"body_end":2605,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[46]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[46,0,3]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[46,5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关平\n(虽然副军师与诸葛军师齐名，\n但是我怎麼覺得他俩其實差得\n遠呢？)"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[46,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":2605,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2630,"body_end":2712,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[47]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周仓\n俺是山贼，在山上特别厉害！\n&刘备\n(…………这不是废话吗？)"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":2712,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2737,"body_end":2958,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[40]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙乾\n我是辎重队，最擅长补给，\n后勤的事情就交给我处理吧。\n&关平\n辎重队的防御力也很高，\n所以孙乾先生也能充当肉盾吗？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[40,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙乾\n这……\n很遗憾的，我的防御是降档的。\n&关平\n………………真可惜。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":2958,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":2983,"body_end":3085,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[45]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘封\n义父，孩儿已经迫不及待啦。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘备\n不错，封儿很有斗志。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[32,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":3085,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":3110,"body_end":3176,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[49]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&马良\n一旦攻下了雒城，\n西川便是我们的囊中物了。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":3176,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":3201,"body_end":3281,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[43]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&简雍\n我叫简雍，我的话说完了。\n&刘备\n(…………我早就知道了。)"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}